      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I encountered this as well. \n\nAttachments:\n\nFirst Log: (World transition starts around Line 8300) Tried joining a world and got the black screen, quit out of VRC through steamVR after about 30 seconds of no response.\n\nSecond Log: (World transitions starts around Line 45600) Tried joining a world and got the black screen, waited for a few minutes before getting a rapid reload loop for a minute or two and then a black screen again. Quit out of VRC through SteamVR afterwards.\n\nA funny bit I noticed in the second log is that the game tried to repeatedly send me to the error world after failing to join the normal world and was unable to.",
