  "details": "Here is the steps :\n\n0 - Join a world with an avatar without any accessories\n\n1 - Add accessories to your avatar with the edit menu\n\n2 - Save and apply.\n\n3 - Switch to an avatar without accessories .\n\n4 - Go in another world.\n\n5 - The game tries to load the world, fails to access it, and reloads (sometimes the game may crash).\n\nI tried both loading screens, the default one and the Loading Cubes, and the issue happens with both.",
